Subject: Connect original effects geometry materials to native GX

Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Retain the original FloatTexturedColour and ConstantColour TEV/alpha recipes.
Use typed Aurora state, bounded host vertex arrays, indexed FIFO writes and
GXEnd. The checked decoder expands ConstantColour's signed 12-fraction UVs
into floats; console vertex formats remain unchanged. Native direct/display
list packets stay unsupported. Reset native singleton state at teardown.

